WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.890
The best way to get started in Basecamp is

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.000
to just jump in.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
So let's start by making a
project. From your home screen

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.060
click make a new project and
give your project a name.

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.910
So for this example, let's
say I'm gonna use Basecamp

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:13.530
to plan a conference.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.300
I'll click create this project,

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.570
and Basecamp spins up a
brand new project for me.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.840
Now it's blank to start. So
we'll want to add some tools.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.400
Now the beauty of Basecamp is

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.440
that every project is customizable.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.150
So you can add the tools that you need

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.920
and change it at any time.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.520
You can use one or two tools,
you can use all the tools.

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:35.190
Every project is incredibly flexible.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.980
So let's say for this project,
I know I'm gonna have lots

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:40.680
of to-dos and tasks
that I'll need to assign

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.120
to myself and to some other people.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:46.230
So let's click that plus
and I'll add to-dos.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.700
I also for this project,

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.460
will probably make some
announcements to the team.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:54.180
So instead of sending emails,
I might want to blast messages

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.830
to everyone within the project.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.170
So for that I'm gonna
add a message board tool

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:02.970
and we'll likely have some
appointments, some deadlines.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:04.680
I'll wanna post those on a calendar.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.780
So I'll add a calendar tool,

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.720
and then we likely will
have some contracts

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:13.080
or other documents we'll
want to keep within Basecamp.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.420
So I'm gonna add docs and files.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:19.230
And then let's also say we
wanna have some casual chats

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:20.580
amongst the team.

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:22.350
I'll add a chat tool.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:26.370
And then there might be some
things that you wanna use an

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.770
outside product or service for.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:32.400
So for this example, I might
have a Google spreadsheet

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.940
that I'm keeping track of
my RSVPs. I can add that

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.650
to keep it within Basecamp as well.

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:40.320
So hitting that plus
button, I can scroll down

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:41.940
to external link.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:45.000
I have lots of options here.
I have a Google Sheet option.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.790
If I post that URL here,

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:52.790
I can call this RSVPs and save that.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:56.760
And that will now show up
on my project page as well.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.030
So this is kind of the
outline or structure.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:02.400
Here's the thing, you can
make changes as you go along.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:03.510
Nothing is permanent.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:04.860
You can always add tools

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:08.700
or delete them, grow your
project as things develop.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.930
So let me jump over

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:12.930
to this project a little more filled out.

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:16.650
So we have to-dos, message
board, calendar, docs and files.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:18.390
Let me show you a couple
of other things you can

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.430
do from your project.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.830
So if I wanted to change
the name of this project,

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:27.000
I could just click on the
title and let's call this 2026.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:31.080
And I also have the option
to add a logo or a image.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.300
So we'll add that here as well.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.880
And you can see I have some
toggle options if I wanna turn

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:39.780
on or off activity, show progress,

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:40.980
Timesheet, those sorts of things.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:43.290
They're all at the top. I also can

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:44.760
rename any of these tools.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.560
So let's say instead of message board,

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.060
I wanna call this announcements.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.750
So I can click on the name
of that tool and rename it.

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:55.290
I also have the option to move

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:57.480
or change the order of my tools.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.010
So let's say I really want
my calendar to be front

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.260
and center, my chat tool.

00:03:02.260 --> 00:03:03.940
Let's move that over here.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:06.250
And then also have the option
of adding duplicate tools.

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.340
So let's say this Docs and
files is really more contracts.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:12.100
So we're gonna rename that to contracts.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.550
And then let's add a
second docs and files tool.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:18.460
And we're gonna use
that one just for photos

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:21.460
and videos that we can
upload to this project.

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.840
You have lots of flexibility when it comes

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:26.950
to setting up your project,

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.660
so take your time, play around with it.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.340
You're not gonna mess anything up.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:32.620
Once you have your project
pretty set the way you want,

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.000
let's invite some people to it.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.560
So we'll do that in the next video.

